\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Links of the critical chain coloured according to Table\nonbreakingspace \ref {tab:attrib}. Top: composition of the B0 and B2 critical chains; the title places ``corridor wait removed'' beside ``makespan actually reduced'', and their difference is the part absorbed by the newly tight constraints. Bottom: the same chain positioned on the time axis, showing that the bars above decompose one chain rather than forming a histogram of unrelated events. In the closed-loop solution, \texttt  {corridor} largely disappears and is replaced by robotic arms and upstream operations.}}{40}{figure.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:case_chain}{{9}{40}{Links of the critical chain coloured according to Table~\ref {tab:attrib}. Top: composition of the B0 and B2 critical chains; the title places ``corridor wait removed'' beside ``makespan actually reduced'', and their difference is the part absorbed by the newly tight constraints. Bottom: the same chain positioned on the time axis, showing that the bars above decompose one chain rather than forming a histogram of unrelated events. In the closed-loop solution, \texttt {corridor} largely disappears and is replaced by robotic arms and upstream operations}{figure.caption.44}{}}
